<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47510" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡραῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of
				Hera</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἥραιον</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡραῖον</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερόν</span>), τό, <i>temple of
				Hera</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Duris
				60
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, etc.: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡραῖα</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), τά, <i>her festiual</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡ. τὰ ἐν Ἄργει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1064.9
				</span></i>
			 (Halic.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.24.2
			</span></i>; epith. of Zeus, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διῒ Ἡραίῳ χοῖρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.840.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡραῖος, ὁ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>), a month at Delphi, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				1693
			</span></i>, al.; at Olus, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5075
			</span></i>: 
				Aeol.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἤραος</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				265.15
			</span></i> (Temnos, from Pergam.):—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡραιών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>, at Tenos, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).875.23
			</span></i>; and Magnesia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				589.13
			</span></i>.</div>
